    "collapsible_content_XARQ78": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_3ecjVN": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What trailers is MoonShade Apex built for?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Apex is designed exclusively for A-frame pop-up trailers and hard-wall pop-up campers. Confirmed trailers include the Aliner, Rockwood Hardside, Flagstaff Hard Wall, Viking Hard Side, and Forest River Rockwood. It fits any A-frame with a smooth exterior surface compatible with Pad Eye, Adhesive Anchor, or Oval MoonMounts.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_Uhgdii": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Will Apex work on a van, SUV, or standard travel trailer?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>No — Apex is built for A-frame trailers only. For vans, SUVs, trucks, or standard trailers, MoonShade, MoonShade XL, MoonShade RV, or MoonShade Pro is the right fit depending on your vehicle.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_xUE8Qy": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why doesn't Apex have legs?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>A-frame trailers have a low entry door. Legs block the walkway. Apex uses a single brow pole to keep the full area under the canopy clear.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_RUYNVb": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I mount Apex on either side of my trailer?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. Apex mounts on both the side door and rear door, so you can reposition it as the sun moves through the day.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_6eLGK9": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What anchors does MoonShade Apex use?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Apex mounts with 3 Oval MoonMounts, Pad Eye anchors, or Adhesive Anchors depending on your trailer's surface.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_HDjtKL": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is MoonShade waterproof?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>We don’t “waterproof” our fabric because it would degrade the integrity of its UV resistance over time. That said, it is seam-sealed and the fabric is a technical 420 ripstop that sheds water like an umbrella.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
